y default: replace; +194/-6 across 5 files, 3 new tests. Judge tier2 PASS verdict 66e7df07. Covers README-2 (same defect).", "foreman_note": "tick 399: worker 270459b2, judge PASS 66e7df07, guard 4/4. README-2 covered by this fix."}
